# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and the working tree. Generators write LF and
# their `--check` modes compare byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout would report a stale file nothing
# changed. Shell hooks and Jenkinsfiles run on Linux agents, where a stray \r breaks them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
